PayCheckNum());\n            return null;\n        }\n        PmcPayChecks payCheck = payChecks.get(0);\n        return payCheck;\n    }\n    private List<PmcPayChecksSupplierInvoicesDTO> convertInvoices(List<PmcPayIcInvoicesData> invoicesDataList, BigDecimal paymentAmount) {\n        BigDecimal[] remainingAmount = {paymentAmount};  // 使用数组来绕过lambda的final限制\n        return invoicesDataList.stream().map(invoice -> {\n            PmcPayChecksSupplierInvoicesDTO dto = new PmcPayChecksSupplierInvoicesDTO();\n            // 假设字段映射 - 请根据实际类结构调整\n            dto.setTaxExcludedAmount(invoice.getInvoiceAmount());\n            dto.setInvoiceDate(invoice.getInvoiceDate());\n            dto.setInvoiceNumber(invoice.getInvoiceNumber());\n            dto.setInvoiceType(invoice.getInvoiceType());\n            dto.setDocumentAmount(invoice.getTotalAmount());\n            dto.setInvoiceCode(invoice.getInvoiceCode());\n            \n            // 计算当前发票应分配的金额\n            BigDecimal invoiceAmount = invoice.getTotalAmount();\n            BigDecimal allocatedAmount = remainingAmount[0].min(invoiceAmount);\n            dto.setPayableAmount(allocatedAmount);\n            \n            // 更新剩余金额\n            remainingAmount[0] = remainingAmount[0].subtract(allocatedAmount);\n            \n            return dto;\n        }).collect(Collectors.toList());\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 发送如流预警消息\n     */\n    private void sendBankFailRuliuMessage(String applyNums) {\n        String receiver = null;\n        FndFlexValueDTO fndFlexValueDTO =\n                fndFlexValueApi.selectByType(BizConstants.FndFlexSet.PMC_ALTER_MAIL, \"RULIU_FINANCE_ADMIN\");\n        if (ObjectUtil.isEmpty(fndFlexValueDTO) ||\n                StringUtils.isEmpty(fndFlexValueDTO.getDescription())) {\n            log.error(\"未配置收件人信息，无法发送消息，配置：{}/{}\", \"PMC_ALTER_MAIL\", \"RULIU_FINANCE_ADMIN\");\n            return;\n        }\n        receiver = fndFlexValueDTO.getDescription();\n\n        Map<String, String> msgProperties = new HashMap<>();\n        msgProperties.put(\"applyNum\", applyNums);\n        eacMsgService.sendInFlowMessage(msgProperties, EacMsgTemplate.FINANCE_SEND_BANK_FAIL_MSG_TMP, null, receiver);\n    }\n}",
